  "privacyNoticeText": "Iwu Nchekwa Data Naịjirịa (NDPA) — Ọkwa Nhazi Data\n\nEWER Mobile (ọrụ CRADI / KusuConsult-NG) na-ahazi data gị maka ebumnobi ịdọ aka ná ntị n'oge gbasara ihe egwu ihu igwe.\n\n• Data a na-anakọta: aha, ekwentị, imel, ebe (steeti/LGA/wọọdụ), akụkọ ihe egwu, na njirimara ngwaọrụ maka ọkwa mbanye.\n• Ebumnobi: ịkọ ihe egwu n'obodo, nnyocha ndị ọgbọ, na ọkwa mberede.\n• Nchekwa: ọdụ data igwe ojii Supabase (PostgreSQL); a na-eziga ọkwa mbanye site na OneSignal, a pụkwara iziga nchọpụta ndakpọ ngwa na Sentry.\n• Mbufe mba ụwa: Dabere n'Isiokwu 24 nke NDPA, anyị na-ekwupụta na enwere ike ibufe data gị ma chekwaa ya na sava ndị dị na mpụga Naịjirịa. Mbufe a dị mkpa iji nye ọrụ a. Ị nwere ikike ịwepụ nkwenye gị n'oge ọ bụla site n'ihichapụ akaụntụ gị.\n• Njigide: A na-edebe data ruo afọ 5 mgbe ọrụ ikpeazụ gị gasịrị, mgbe ahụ a na-ewepụ njirimara ya.\n• Ikike gị: inweta, imezi, ihichapụ, na ibufe data gị n'okpuru NDPA 2023.\n\nSite n'ịpị \"Ekwere m\", ị kwenyere n'usoro ndị a na mbufe data onwe gị gaa mba ụwa.",
